tests/golden/check/catalogue-a-table-naming-the-program-is-refused.case/main.hero:5:5: error[catalogue_refused]: `use <json>/parse` reaches a package through the catalogue, and it does not read: tests/golden/check/catalogue-a-table-naming-the-program-is-refused.case/heroes.toml:1: a table is `[dependencies.<name>]`, one per entry, found `[package]`; a catalogue holds the dependencies of the program or the package at whose root it stands and, above them, the one `index` line naming where they are read from, and nothing else — a catalogue that does not read names no package, the lines above that one included
